    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to present 12 Kirkpatrick House to the open market for sale. No.12 is a bright, well-presented two-bedroom apartment situated on the first floor of Kirkpatrick House in the prestigious Spencer Dock development, offering commanding views across Dublin city and the Docklands.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged and comprises an entrance hall with generous storage, a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining room complemented by a fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned double bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The living area is a well proportioned sized accommodation space, perfect for evening relaxation. The living area has sliding doors leading onto the sizeable balcony area over looking the internal manicured courtyard. The apartment is finished to a high standard, with laminated wooden flooring providing a classic look along with the tiled bathrooms and kitchen creating a modern finish. The rooms benefit from large windows keeping the property airy and bright. \r\n\r\nThe property is positioned within one of Dublin's most sought-after urban addresses. The IFSC quarter offers an exceptional array of restaurants, cafés, retail outlets, and commercial amenities, including Marks & Spencer, Milano, Sprout & Co, the CHQ Building, The Harbourmaster, and The Spencer Hotel. The Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, accessed via the Samuel Beckett or William Casey bridges, places world-class entertainment within easy reach. Transport connections are excellent, with DART, Luas, Dublin Bus, and intercity rail services all serving the area, ensuring swift and convenient access to the wider city and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis is a perfect opportunity to acquire a well-maintained property in a prime Dublin location. Early viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\nContact us on 01-4964612 to arrange."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
